.Dd October 24, 2026
.Dt WISP 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm wisp
.Nd local-first differential OKF knowledge store
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm wisp
.Op Fl -repo Ar dir
.Op Fl -actor Ar id
.Op Fl -json
.Op Fl -quiet
.Ar command
.Op Ar args ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
stores an Open Knowledge Format (OKF) bundle as an append-only, section-level
changeset log with a hot SQLite tier and cold payload files
.Pq plain by default at Cm init ,
encrypted when initialized with Cm init Fl -encrypt ) .
The ledger is authoritative; managed markdown on disk is a cache refreshed
asynchronously after headless commits unless a barrier runs.
It materializes conformant markdown on checkout and supports agent commits with
optimistic concurrency.
.Pp
This manual page is an overview.
Behavioral contracts, exit codes, JSON envelopes, and per-command semantics live
in installed topic documentation (see below), not in
.Cm --help
alone.
.Pp
Agent fleets: see installed
.Pa AGENT-WRITERS.md
.Pq Cm wisp doc AGENT-WRITERS.md
and
.Pa WORKTREE.md
.Pq Cm wisp doc WORKTREE.md ) .
.Ss Write paths
.Bl -tag -width 14n
.It Cm record
Working-tree edits become one changeset; OKF files are re-rendered.
Drains the materialize queue before return.
.Fl -resolve
clears
.Pa .wisp/merge.json
after a successful record during merge resolution (not exit-3 retry).
.It Cm update , Nm add-section , Nm set , Nm create , Nm apply
Headless writes (no working-tree round-trip).
Each single-op command is shorthand for one entry in an
.Cm apply
batch; see topic
.Cm apply .
.It Cm apply Fl -resolve
On
.Va section_conflict
.Pq exit 3 ,
refresh
.Va base_version
from hot and retry until success or the attempt budget is exhausted.
.It Cm queue Fl -serve
Run the bundle commit queue writer on
.Pa .wisp/commit.sock .
Enable with
.Va queue.enabled
in
.Pa manifest.toml
(or
.Cm wisp config set queue.enabled true )
before headless
.Cm apply
uses the socket.
See
.Cm wisp doc commit-queue .
.It Cm materialize
Flush the async worktree materialize queue.
.Fl -wait
blocks until pending publish jobs for managed checkouts finish.
Use before tools that read bundle paths without using hot APIs.
.El
.Pp
After headless
.Cm apply
without
.Fl -resolve ,
call
.Cm materialize Fl -wait
or read via
.Cm cat
and search APIs.
.Ss Installed documentation
Installed topic files (Markdown) are the contract for agents and integrators:
.Bl -tag -width 16n
.It Cm wisp doc list
List topics and file paths.
.It Cm wisp doc path
Print the documentation directory
.Pq typically
.Pa ~/.local/share/wisp/doc ) .
.It Cm wisp doc cli
CLI contract: exit codes, target grammar, JSON, limits of success.
.It Cm wisp doc Ar topic
Print a topic
.Pq e.g. Cm erase , Cm merge , Cm search , Cm impact , Cm trust ) .
.El
.Pp
Set
.Ev WISP_DOC_ROOT
if documentation was installed elsewhere.
.Ss Exit status
.Bl -tag -width 10n
.It Dv 0
Success.
.It Dv 2
Usage error.
.It Dv 3
Conflict (stale
.Fl -base ,
merge conflict; see JSON
.Cm error.code ) .
.It Dv 4
Policy refusal.
.It Dv 5
Validation failure.
.It Dv 7
Retryable SQLite lock (back off and retry).
.It Dv 8
Integrity / fsck failure.
.It Dv 9
Key unavailable.
.It Dv 10
Erasure recovery pending; reopen or complete recovery.
.El
.Pp
Details:
.Cm wisp doc cli
and
.Pa CONCURRENCY.md .
.Ss Environment
.Bl -tag -width 16n
.It Ev WISP_ACTOR
Default actor when
.Fl -actor
is omitted.
.It Ev WISP_DOC_ROOT
Override documentation directory for
.Cm wisp doc .
.It Ev WISP_MASTER_KEY
Master key material (see trust docs).
.It Ev XDG_DATA_HOME
Base for
.Pa wisp/doc
when
.Ev WISP_DOC_ROOT
is unset.
.El
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width 12n
.It Fl -repo Ar dir
Repository root (default: nearest ancestor containing
.Pa .wisp/ ) .
.It Fl -actor Ar string
Actor:
.Ar producer/version ,
.Cm human:id ,
or
.Cm process:id
(default:
.Ev WISP_ACTOR ,
then config).
.It Fl -json
Write exactly one JSON object to stdout
.Pq Cm ok ,
.Cm command ,
.Cm data
or
.Cm error .
Human text goes to stderr.
.It Fl -quiet
Suppress human-readable stdout.
.It Fl -passphrase Ar string
Unlock keystore for encrypted repositories (alternative to key file or
.Ev WISP_MASTER_KEY ) .
.It Fl -encrypt
With
.Cm init ,
store cold payloads encrypted and create
.Pa .wisp/keys/master.key .
.It Fl -no-index
Skip in-process subscribers for this invocation.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width 20n
.It Pa ~/.local/share/wisp/doc/
Default topic documentation (user install).
.It Pa ~/.local/share/man/man1/wisp.1
Default manual page (user install).
.It Pa .wisp/
Bundle metadata, ledger, keys, cache (per repository).
.It Pa .wisp/manifest.toml
Repository config
.Pq Cm wisp config ) :
.Va repo.storage
.Pq Cm plain
or
.Cm encrypted ,
.Va commit.busy_timeout_ms ,
.Va commit.retries ,
.Va queue.enabled ,
.Va queue.timeout_ms ,
.Va materialize.enabled ,
.Va materialize.tick_ms .
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Cm wisp doc cli ,
.Cm wisp doc erase ,
.Cm wisp doc merge ,
.Cm wisp doc search ,
.Cm wisp doc impact ,
.Cm wisp doc apply ,
.Cm wisp doc trust
.Pp
